     ],
     "texte": "it looks like you're not listening, but it's actually [[the opposite]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "that sounds harsh, but",
      "it's actually good news"
     ],
     "texte": "in one study, doodlers [[remembered more]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "if it's your fault, it's also",
      "in your control, you don't",
      "have to be the person",
      "you were yesterday, you",
      "can change"
     ],
     "texte": "of a dull phone message than people who just sat there listening. a bit of scribbling stops your mind from drifting off"
    }
